{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00966","headline":"横吹曲辞 入塞曲 一 · 沈彬","name":"横吹曲辞 入塞曲 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲爲皇王服远戎，万人金甲鼓鼙中。\n阵云暗塞三边黑，兵血愁天一片红。\n半夜飜营旗搅月，深秋防戍劒磨风。\n谤书未及明君爇，卧骨将军已殁功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}